; +-----------------------------------------+
; Nyao Scalper v50.0 - HIGH-RISK PROFILE
; © Copyright Nyao Scalper by Elriz Wiraswara
; +-----------------------------------------+
; The default profile's rules with twice the risk per trade: higher return, deeper drawdowns.
; EXPERIMENTAL - backtested only; demo forward-test before using real money. Attach it to an M5 chart.
; Differences from settings/default.set (everything else is identical):
;   RiskPerTradePct 2.5 (default 1.25): the lot loses at most 2.5% at the $20 stop - 0.02 lot on
;           $2,000 (2%), 0.01 lot below about $1,600; below about $800 that 0.01 lot risks more
;           than 2.5% and is still traded down to about $400 (MaxRiskPerTradePct 5, as in the default).
;   MaxLotSize 0.10 (default 0.05): lets a $100 cent account trade 0.10 lot (2%).
; Backtest v50.0, $2,000 per month (each month a fresh run), sums of monthly returns:
;   Jan-Sep 2026, real ticks (reports/high-risk-2026-real-ticks):
;     M5: +176.4%, 5/9 months up, worst month -16.1%, max DD 36.3%, PF 1.19
;     M1: +4.0%, 5/9 months up, worst month -27.0%, max DD 46.3%, PF 1.00
;   2025, ticks generated from 1-minute bars (reports/high-risk-2025):
;     M5: +97.4%, 11/12 months up, worst month -0.6%, max DD 26.4%, PF 1.27
;     M1: +78.3%, 9/12 months up, worst month -8.8%, max DD 23.6%, PF 1.20
;   M5 by year: 2022 -15.1% / 2023 -7.9% / 2024 -4.7% / 2025 +97.4% / Jan-Sep 2026 +176.4%
;   57 months on M5: +246.1% (default.set +130.2%), 30/57 months up, worst month -16.4%
;   (default -5.7%), max drawdown 36.3% (default 20.0%).
;   Doubling the risk doubled the size of the edge, not the edge itself: return per unit of
;   drawdown stayed the same. 3.75% and 5% risk made more but with 52-64% drawdowns. Frequent M1
;   trading (entries during the bar, 4 positions, $1.50 apart) lost up to 60% in a month at 2.5%.
;   Both were rejected. Like the default, the profile loses in years when gold moves sideways.
; Requirements / warnings:
;   - Account: $2,000+ standard, or $100+ cent (balance in cents). Expect -16% months.
;   - Needs a hedging account (up to 2 positions open).
;   - Use M5: on M1 the same rules made almost nothing in 2026 with -27% months.
; +-----------------------------------------+
